<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Le mot fléché de la rentrée | ekodev by EPSA</title>
<meta name="description" content="Une grille de mots fléchés RSE avant la rentrée, avec un mot mystère à découvrir — par ekodev by EPSA.">
<style>
  :root{
    --forest: #0B3B3C;
    --forest-deep: #072526;
    --gold: #F2C230;
    --gold-soft: #FCF3D8;
    --gold-ink: #6b4f06;
    --blue-grey: #9FB6BE;
    --paper: #FFFFFF;
    --paper-soft: #F5F7F6;
    --ink: #12201F;
    --ink-soft: #4C5A58;
    --line: #DDE4E2;
    --radius: 10px;
  }

  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }
  html{ -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }

  body{
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper-soft);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Noto Sans", sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  a{ color: var(--forest); }
  a:focus-visible,
  button:focus-visible,
  input:focus-visible{
    outline: 3px solid var(--gold);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  /* ---------- Header ---------- */
  header{
    background: var(--forest);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 2.25rem 1.25rem 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  header::before{
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -60px;
    left: -60px;
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    border: 22px solid rgba(242, 194, 48, 0.16);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .brand{
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: .35rem;
    font-size: .95rem;
    letter-spacing: .02em;
    color: var(--blue-grey);
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
  }
  .brand strong{ color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  header h1{
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 32rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 4.2vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    position: relative;
  }
  header p.kicker{
    margin: .6rem auto 0;
    max-width: 28rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    font-size: .95rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* ---------- Main ---------- */
  main{ max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.1rem 3rem; }

  .intro{
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0 0 .75rem;
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .intro strong{ color: var(--ink); }

  .mystery-hint{
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--gold-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--gold);
    color: var(--gold-ink);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: .82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: .5rem 1rem;
    max-width: fit-content;
    margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
  }

  /* ---------- Fallback (no-JS) ---------- */
  noscript .fallback{
    display: block;
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .fallback h2{ font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 .75rem; }
  .fallback ol{ margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .fallback li{ margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .fallback .cta{ margin-top: 1rem; }
  .fallback .cta a{ font-weight: 700; }

  /* ---------- Grid wrapper ---------- */
  .grid-wrapper{
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .grid-scroll{
    overflow: auto;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    max-height: 68vh;
    padding-bottom: .35rem;
  }
  #grid{ display: grid; gap: 2px; width: max-content; margin: 0 auto; }
  #grid:empty::before{
    content: "Chargement de la grille…";
    display: block;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: .9rem;
    padding: 1rem;
  }
  .cell-wrap{ position: relative; width: 1.85rem; height: 1.85rem; }
  .cell-blocked{ width: 1.85rem; height: 1.85rem; }
  .cell-number{
    position: absolute;
    top: 1px;
    left: 2px;
    font-size: .5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .cell-bonus-badge{
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -3px;
    right: -3px;
    width: 1rem;
    height: 1rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--forest);
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: .55rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    line-height: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 3;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1.5px #fff;
  }
  .cell-wrap input{
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: inherit;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper-soft);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0;
    caret-color: var(--forest);
  }
  .cell-wrap input:focus{ background: #fff; border-color: var(--forest); }
  .cell-wrap.is-active-word input{ background: #EAF1F0; }
  .cell-wrap.is-revealed input{ background: var(--gold-soft); border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold-ink); }
  .cell-wrap.is-solved input{ border-color: var(--gold); }

  @media (min-width: 480px){
    .cell-wrap, .cell-blocked{ width: 2.1rem; height: 2.1rem; }
    .cell-wrap input{ font-size: 1.1rem; }
  }

  /* ---------- Mystery strip (outside the grid) ---------- */
  .mystery-wrapper{
    background: var(--forest);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.1rem 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .mystery-wrapper h2{
    color: #fff;
    font-size: .95rem;
    margin: 0 0 .2rem;
  }
  .mystery-wrapper p{
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    font-size: .8rem;
    margin: 0 0 .9rem;
  }
  .mystery-boxes{
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: .3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .mystery-box{
    width: 1.8rem;
    height: 2.1rem;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(242,194,48,0.5);
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    position: relative;
  }
  .mystery-box .idx{
    position: absolute;
    top: 1px;
    left: 3px;
    font-size: .5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
  }
  .mystery-box.is-filled{ background: rgba(242,194,48,0.18); }

  /* ---------- Clue lists ---------- */
  .clue-columns{
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 560px){
    .clue-columns{ grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  .clue-block h2{
    font-size: .85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 .6rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .4rem;
  }
  .clue-list{ list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .4rem; }
  .clue-item{
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: .55rem .7rem;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: .85rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .clue-item:hover{ border-color: var(--blue-grey); }
  .clue-item.is-active{ border-color: var(--forest); background: #EAF1F0; }
  .clue-item.is-solved{ border-color: var(--gold); }
  .clue-item .num{ font-weight: 700; color: var(--forest); margin-right: .3rem; }
  .clue-item .count{ color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: .78rem; }

  /* ---------- Actions ---------- */
  .actions{ text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  #reveal-btn{
    appearance: none;
    border: none;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--forest-deep);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: .95rem;
    padding: .8rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  #reveal-btn:hover{ background: #e6b41c; }
  .actions p{ margin: .75rem 0 0; font-size: .82rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  /* ---------- Bonus banner ---------- */
  #bonus-banner{
    display: none;
    background: var(--forest);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1.4rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
  }
  #bonus-banner.is-visible{ display: block; }
  #bonus-banner p{ margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 1rem; }
  #bonus-banner strong{ color: var(--gold); }
  #bonus-banner a{
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--forest-deep);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: .75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  #bonus-banner a:hover{ background: #e6b41c; }

  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */
  footer{
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem 2.5rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: .85rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  footer a{ color: var(--ink-soft); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
  footer a:hover{ color: var(--forest); }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .cell-wrap input{ transition: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="brand"><strong>ekodev</strong> by epsa</div>
  <h1>🧩 Le mot fléché de la rentrée</h1>
  <p class="kicker">Un dernier jeu avant de reprendre les choses sérieuses — avec un mot mystère à la clé.</p>
